#: ../../tools.md:1
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../tools.md:3
msgid ""
"minacode uses tools to inspect your project and act on it. You describe "
"the outcome you want; the agent chooses the tools. Tool calls are shown "
"in the terminal as they run. They are separate from the `/` commands you "
"type yourself. Read-only tools may run concurrently; actions that can "
"change your system ask for confirmation unless `--yolo` or `/yolo` is "
"active."
msgstr ""
"minacode 使用工具检查项目并执行操作。你描述目标，由 agent 选择工具。工具调用会在运行时显示在终端中，它们与你输入的 `/` "
"命令不同。只读工具可以并发运行；可能改变系统的操作会请求确认，除非已启用 `--yolo` 或 `/yolo`。"

#: ../../tools.md:9
msgid "Built-in tools"
msgstr "内置工具"

#: ../../tools.md:16
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../tools.md:17
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../tools.md:18
msgid "**`Read`**"
msgstr "**`Read`**"

#: ../../tools.md:19
msgid ""
"Opens selected line ranges from one or several UTF-8 files. Every "
"returned line has an anchor that later edits can verify."
msgstr "读取一个或多个 UTF-8 文件中的指定行范围。返回的每一行都有可供后续编辑验证的锚点。"

#: ../../tools.md:22
msgid "A shortened result looks like this:"
msgstr "缩短后的结果如下："

#: ../../tools.md:37
msgid ""
"In `684:234ew`, `684` is the line number and `234ew` is a short hash of "
"that line's content. The line number locates the edit; the hash proves "
"that the line has not changed since it was read. Line numbers are one-"
"based and ranges include both ends, matching what `grep -n`, your editor,"
" tracebacks, and diffs show, so `Read`, `Search`, and `InspectCode` all "
"agree on which line is which."
msgstr ""
"在 `684:234ew` 中，`684` 是行号，`234ew` 是该行内容的短 hash。行号用于定位编辑位置，hash "
"用于确认该行自读取后没有变化。行号从 1 开始，区间两端都包含，与 `grep -n`、编辑器、traceback 和 diff 显示的一致，因此"
" `Read`、`Search`、`InspectCode` 对「哪一行是哪一行」的判断完全一致。"

#: ../../tools.md:42
msgid "**`ViewImage`**"
msgstr "**`ViewImage`**"

#: ../../tools.md:43
msgid ""
"Opens one local PNG, JPEG, WebP, or single-frame GIF as visual input for "
"the active model. The agent can use it proactively for screenshots, "
"mockups, diagrams, and generated assets. Images outside the workspace "
"require confirmation. When the active provider/model cannot take images, "
"a configured [vision model](configuration.md#vision-model) describes them"
" instead."
msgstr ""
"将一个本地 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或单帧 GIF 作为视觉输入提供给当前模型。Agent 可主动用它查看截图、模型图、图表和生成的素材。查看"
" workspace 外的图片需要确认。当当前 provider/model 无法接收图片时，配置了 [vision "
"model](configuration.md#vision-model) 会改由视觉模型描述图片。"

#: ../../tools.md:47
msgid "**`Search`**"
msgstr "**`Search`**"

#: ../../tools.md:48
msgid ""
"Finds text with case-insensitive regular expressions, optionally limited "
"by path or filename pattern. It skips hidden, binary, and gitignored "
"files and returns editable anchors."
msgstr "使用不区分大小写的正则表达式搜索文本，也可限制路径或文件名模式。它会跳过隐藏文件、二进制文件和被 gitignore 的文件，并返回可编辑锚点。"

#: ../../tools.md:50
msgid "**`InspectCode`**"
msgstr "**`InspectCode`**"

#: ../../tools.md:51
msgid ""
"Finds definitions, references, implementations, callers, callees, and "
"file outlines through the [code index](#code-symbol-index). Use it for "
"code structure rather than exact text."
msgstr ""
"通过[代码索引](#code-symbol-index)查找定义、引用、实现、调用者、被调用者和文件 "
"outline。它适合分析代码结构，而不是精确文本搜索。"

#: ../../tools.md:53
msgid "**`Edit`**"
msgstr "**`Edit`**"

#: ../../tools.md:54
msgid ""
"Creates or changes one UTF-8 file by inserting, replacing, or deleting "
"content. For an anchored change, `Edit` sends back the `line:hash` value "
"returned by `Read`, `Search`, or `InspectCode`. minacode checks the "
"current line immediately before writing and <span "
"class=\"marker\">refuses the edit if the hash no longer matches</span>. A"
" successful edit also refunds the new anchors for the region it changed, "
"so consecutive edits to the same file keep going without re-reading it "
"first. Successful edits appear in [`/diff`](usage.md#reviewing-changes)."
msgstr ""
"通过插入、替换或删除内容来创建或修改一个 UTF-8 文件。执行锚点编辑时，`Edit` 会回传 `Read`、`Search` 或 "
"`InspectCode` 返回的 `line:hash`。minacode 会在写入前立即检查当前行；如果 hash 不再匹配，<span "
"class=\"marker\">编辑会被拒绝</span>。成功的编辑还会回传改动区域的新锚点，因此连续编辑同一文件无需先重新 "
"Read。成功的编辑会出现在 [`/diff`](usage.md#reviewing-changes) 中。"

#: ../../tools.md:62
msgid "An Edit confirmation previewing the proposed diff"
msgstr "Edit 确认界面预览拟议 diff"

#: ../../tools.md:67
msgid "An Edit confirmation previews the proposed change before approval."
msgstr "确认前，Edit 会预览拟议修改。"

#: ../../tools.md:69
msgid "**`Bash`**"
msgstr "**`Bash`**"

#: ../../tools.md:70
msgid ""
"Runs one shell command in the project with live output. Commands still "
"running after `runtime.bash_wait_timeout` <span class=\"marker\">become "
"background jobs automatically</span>."
msgstr ""
"在项目中运行一条 shell 命令，并实时显示输出。运行超过 `runtime.bash_wait_timeout` 的命令会<span "
"class=\"marker\">自动转为后台任务</span>。"

#: ../../tools.md:73
msgid "A Bash tool call streaming command output in minacode"
msgstr "Bash 工具调用在 minacode 中流式显示命令输出"

#: ../../tools.md:78
msgid "Bash output appears as the command runs."
msgstr "Bash 输出会随命令运行实时出现。"

#: ../../tools.md:80
msgid "**`Job`**"
msgstr "**`Job`**"

#: ../../tools.md:81
msgid ""
"Starts or manages background commands: check output, wait, list, or stop."
" The same jobs are visible through `/ps`."
msgstr "启动或管理后台命令：查看输出、等待、列出或停止。相同任务也可通过 `/ps` 查看。"

#: ../../tools.md:83
msgid "**`Recall`**"
msgstr "**`Recall`**"

#: ../../tools.md:84
msgid ""
"Retrieves a <span class=\"marker\">complete earlier tool result</span>, "
"or selected line ranges, when only a shortened result was placed in the "
"conversation."
msgstr "当对话中只有缩短结果时，取回<span class=\"marker\">完整的早期工具结果</span>或指定行范围。"

#: ../../tools.md:86
msgid "**`RecallContext`**"
msgstr "**`RecallContext`**"

#: ../../tools.md:87
msgid ""
"Lists stored compacted segments newest first, retrieves an excerpt by its"
" `seg.N` key, or searches titles and text with a case-insensitive regex "
"such as `cache prefix|task memory`. Listing supports pagination; search "
"results are capped matching lines. Segment titles are loaded only on "
"demand instead of occupying every request. A key older than the [retained"
" window](context.md#compaction) says so."
msgstr ""
"按从新到旧的顺序列出已存储的 compacted segment，通过 `seg.N` key 取回摘录，或使用不区分大小写的正则表达式（例如 "
"`cache prefix|task memory`）搜索标题和文本。列表支持分页，搜索结果会限制匹配行数。Segment "
"标题仅在需要时加载，不会占据每次请求。早于[保留窗口](context.md#compaction)的 key 会明确告知。"

#: ../../tools.md:92
msgid "**`Note`**"
msgstr "**`Note`**"

#: ../../tools.md:93
msgid ""
"Views or updates the task's goal, plan, success check, and learned facts."
" Updates are durable conversation history, so they preserve append-only "
"prompt-cache prefixes and do not edit files."
msgstr ""
"查看或更新任务的 goal、plan、成功检查和已知事实。更新会成为持久对话历史，因此可以保持 append-only prompt-cache "
"前缀，且不会编辑文件。"

#: ../../tools.md:98
msgid ""
"Plan items are marked `[x]` done, `[~]` in progress, `[ ]` waiting, or "
"`[-]` blocked."
msgstr "Plan 条目使用 `[x]` 表示完成、`[~]` 表示进行中、`[ ]` 表示等待、`[-]` 表示阻塞。"

#: ../../tools.md:99
msgid "**`Ask`**"
msgstr "**`Ask`**"

#: ../../tools.md:100
msgid ""
"Pauses for a decision that genuinely needs you. A question may include "
"choices and a recommended option."
msgstr "在确实需要用户决定时暂停。问题可以包含选项和推荐项。"

#: ../../tools.md:105
msgid ""
"Pressing `Esc` declines the question; typing instead of choosing answers "
"in free text."
msgstr "按 `Esc` 可拒绝问题；直接输入文字可自由回答，而不必选择预设项。"

#: ../../tools.md:106
msgid "**`NextHints`**"
msgstr "**`NextHints`**"

#: ../../tools.md:107
msgid ""
"Offers 2–3 short next-step prompts the model suggests after its answer. "
"They appear as selectable chips at the idle prompt, flowing left to right"
" with up to three per line and wrapping when the terminal is too narrow "
"so every suggestion stays visible; `Tab` cycles focus, `Enter` picks a "
"chip into the input and returns to the prompt, so `Tab` to the next chip "
"and `Enter` again combines several before sending. An all-`NextHints` "
"batch ends the turn in a single model call."
msgstr ""
"在回答之后给出模型建议的 2–3 条简短的下一步。它们以可选择的 chip 形式出现在 idle "
"提示符处，从左到右排布、每行最多三个，终端太窄时才会折行，因此每条建议都能看到；`Tab` 循环切换焦点，`Enter` 把 chip "
"选进输入框并返回提示符，因此 `Tab` 移到下一个 chip 再按 `Enter` 即可组合多个后再发送。一整批都是 `NextHints` "
"的调用会在一次模型调用内结束这个回合。"

#: ../../tools.md:116
msgid ""
"`Tab` moves the highlight; `Enter` picks the focused chip into the input "
"line and returns to the prompt, so `Tab` to the next chip and `Enter` "
"again combines several; a final `Enter` sends. Focus a picked chip and "
"press `Enter` to unpick it."
msgstr ""
"`Tab` 移动高亮；`Enter` 把聚焦的 chip 选进输入行并返回提示符，因此 `Tab` 移到下一个 chip 再按 `Enter` "
"即可组合多个；最后按一次 `Enter` 发送。重新聚焦已选中的 chip 并按 `Enter` 可取消选中。"

#: ../../tools.md:119
msgid "**`Skill`**"
msgstr "**`Skill`**"

#: ../../tools.md:120
msgid ""
"Loads an installed skill's full instructions when needed. It appears only"
" when skills are installed; see [Skills](skills.md)."
msgstr "按需加载已安装 skill 的完整指令。仅当存在已安装 skill 时才会出现；见 [Skills](skills.md)。"

#: ../../tools.md:122
msgid "**`MCP`**"
msgstr "**`MCP`**"

#: ../../tools.md:123
msgid ""
"Describes or calls tools and reads resources from a connected MCP server."
" It appears only after a server is connected; see [MCP](mcp.md)."
msgstr "描述或调用已连接 MCP server 的工具，并读取其资源。仅在 server 连接后出现；见 [MCP](mcp.md)。"

#: ../../tools.md:125
msgid "**`ToolScript`**"
msgstr "**`ToolScript`**"

#: ../../tools.md:126
msgid ""
"Runs a Python script the agent writes, so many tool calls happen in one "
"call instead of one at a time. Only what the script prints returns to the"
" conversation, which saves tokens; see [ToolScript](#toolscript)."
msgstr ""
"运行 agent 写的一段 Python 脚本,把多次工具调用合并成一次。只有脚本 print 的内容回到对话,从而省 token;见 "
"[ToolScript](#toolscript)。"

#: ../../tools.md:129
msgid "**`Delegate`**"
msgstr "**`Delegate`**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid ""
"Hands a bounded task to a second in-process session (the worker) that "
"runs on its own configured provider with a reduced tool set, keeping its "
"context across delegations until reset. It appears only when [worker "
"delegation](worker.md#worker-delegation) is enabled."
msgstr ""
"将有限的任务交给同一进程内的第二个会话（worker）执行：worker 使用自己配置的 provider "
"和精简后的工具集，并在各次委派之间保留上下文，直到被重置。仅当启用 [worker delegation](worker.md#worker-"
"delegation) 时才会出现。"

#: ../../tools.md:137
msgid "ToolScript"
msgstr "ToolScript"

#: ../../tools.md:139
msgid ""
"`ToolScript` is how the agent makes many tool calls at once: it writes "
"one small Python program, and inside it a `call()` is a tool call. "
"Because the calls are code, the agent can loop over a list, branch on a "
"result, or feed one call's output into the next - then run the whole "
"thing as one call."
msgstr ""
"`ToolScript` 让 agent 一次发起很多次工具调用:它写一段小 Python 程序,程序里的 `call()` "
"就是一次工具调用。因为是代码,agent 可以循环遍历列表、根据结果分支、把一次调用的输出喂给下一次——然后整个程序作为一次调用执行。"

#: ../../tools.md:144
msgid ""
"The payoff is tokens: the calls the script makes, and everything they "
"print, never enter the conversation - only the few lines it prints at the"
" end come back. A run that would have taken a dozen tool messages, each "
"output filling the context, now costs one."
msgstr ""
"好处是省 token:脚本发起的调用和它们的输出都不会进对话,回来的只有脚本最后 print 的那几行。本来要占十几条 tool "
"消息、每条输出都撑一块上下文的事,现在只占一次。"

#: ../../tools.md:148
msgid ""
"The log stays compact: the script's calls hang indented under it on one "
"`│` rail down to the result line, so the whole batch reads as work the "
"script did - not calls the agent made one by one."
msgstr "日志也很紧凑:脚本发出的调用缩进记在它下面,由一条 `│` 竖线连到结果行,整批读起来是脚本干的活,而不是 agent 逐个发出的调用。"

#: ../../tools.md:154
msgid ""
"The log shows the first lines of a script, not all of it. To see the "
"whole thing: pick **View script** at the confirmation prompt (or type "
"`v`), or press **`Ctrl-O`** after it ran and pick the script from the "
"list. Both open a read-only viewer with the full script and, after the "
"run, the result it returned. Under `--yolo` there is no confirmation "
"prompt, so `Ctrl-O` is the only way."
msgstr ""
"日志只显示脚本的开头几行。想看完整内容:确认提示时选中 **View script**(或输入 `v`),或跑完后按 **`Ctrl-O`** "
"从列表里选中脚本。两者都打开只读查看器,显示完整脚本;跑完后还会附上返回的结果。`--yolo` 下没有确认提示,只能走 `Ctrl-O`。"

#: ../../tools.md:162
msgid ""
"A script has the same privileges as `Bash` - there is no sandbox. Every "
"run asks for confirmation showing the script's opening lines; `--yolo` "
"skips it, as with `Bash`."
msgstr "脚本的权限和 `Bash` 一样,没有沙箱。每次运行都会请求确认,并展示脚本的开头几行;`--yolo` 会跳过,规则同 `Bash`。"

#: ../../tools.md:166
msgid "Provider-side tools"
msgstr "Provider 侧工具"

#: ../../tools.md:168
msgid ""
"Some providers can <span class=\"marker\">search the web "
"themselves</span>, as part of answering. The model searches, reads the "
"pages, and answers with sources, without minacode running anything. This "
"is off by default; turn it on with [`builtin_tools`](configuration.md"
"#provider-side-tools)."
msgstr ""
"部分 Provider 可以在回答过程中<span "
"class=\"marker\">自己联网搜索</span>。模型自行搜索、阅读网页并给出带来源的回答，minacode "
"不执行任何东西。该能力默认关闭，通过 [`builtin_tools`](configuration.md#provider-side-"
"tools) 开启。"

#: ../../tools.md:172
msgid ""
"You see a line for each search, `web search` as the working phase while "
"it runs, and the pages it read listed under the answer:"
msgstr "每次搜索都会有一行提示，运行期间工作阶段显示为 `web search`，读过的页面列在回答下方："

#: ../../tools.md:177
msgid "Sources appear when the provider reports them; not all of them do."
msgstr "只有 Provider 返回来源时才会显示；并非所有 Provider 都会返回。"

#: ../../tools.md:179
msgid ""
"Unlike the tools above, a search is never confirmed — it happens inside "
"the model's own reply, so the only control is whether you enable it. What"
" it reads is untrusted web text, and it makes the turn larger than it "
"would otherwise be. Leave it off when the agent runs unattended, or when "
"the questions themselves are sensitive."
msgstr "与上面的工具不同，搜索不会经过确认——它发生在模型自己的回复内部，唯一的控制手段就是是否启用。它读取的是不可信的网页文本，并且会让这一轮变得更大。在无人值守运行、或问题本身涉及敏感信息时，请保持关闭。"

#: ../../tools.md:184
msgid "Code symbol index"
msgstr "代码符号索引"

#: ../../tools.md:186
msgid ""
"minacode includes a **code symbol index** for <span "
"class=\"marker\">structured navigation</span> — finding definitions, "
"callers, references, and implementations without relying on an external "
"language server. The index is <span class=\"marker\">built separately for"
" each project</span>."
msgstr ""
"minacode 内置**代码符号索引**，用于<span class=\"marker\">结构化导航</span>：无需外部 language"
" server 即可查找定义、调用者、引用和实现。索引会<span class=\"marker\">按项目分别构建</span>。"

#: ../../tools.md:190
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "它是什么"

#: ../../tools.md:192
msgid ""
"The index is a static database of symbols (functions, classes, methods, "
"variables, etc.) extracted from your project's source files. It is built "
"by a library called [code-symbol-index](https://github.com/hit9/code-"
"symbol-index), which supports a broad set of languages."
msgstr ""
"索引是从项目源文件中提取的符号（function、class、method、variable 等）静态数据库。它由 [code-symbol-"
"index](https://github.com/hit9/code-symbol-index) 构建，支持多种语言。"

#: ../../tools.md:197
msgid "When the index is available, the `InspectCode` tool can:"
msgstr "索引可用时，`InspectCode` 可以："

#: ../../tools.md:199
msgid "**Find symbols** by name with fuzzy matching"
msgstr "按名称进行模糊匹配，**查找符号**"

#: ../../tools.md:200
msgid "**Inspect a symbol** — show its definition and members"
msgstr "**检查符号** — 显示其定义和成员"

#: ../../tools.md:201
msgid ""
"**List references** — call, read, write, and type references across the "
"project"
msgstr "**列出引用** — 项目中的 call、read、write 和 type 引用"

#: ../../tools.md:202
msgid "**Walk call chains** — transitive callers and callees"
msgstr "**遍历调用链** — 递归查找调用者和被调用者"

#: ../../tools.md:203
msgid "**File outlines** — symbol tree of a single file"
msgstr "**文件 outline** — 显示单个文件的符号树"

#: ../../tools.md:205
msgid ""
"Asking where `MCPManager` is defined returns the symbol itself, not every"
" line that mentions the word:"
msgstr "询问 `MCPManager` 在哪里定义时，返回的是符号本身，而不是所有提到该单词的行："

#: ../../tools.md:210
msgid ""
"Each hit carries its file and line range, so the agent can open exactly "
"the right lines. The same index answers \"who calls this\" and \"what "
"implements this\" the same way."
msgstr "每个结果都包含文件和行范围，因此 agent 可以只打开准确位置。同一索引也可以回答“谁调用它”和“谁实现它”。"

#: ../../tools.md:214
msgid ""
"Without an index, `InspectCode` reports that the index is unavailable. "
"Run `/index` once in a project to build it."
msgstr "没有索引时，`InspectCode` 会报告索引不可用。在项目中运行一次 `/index` 即可构建。"

#: ../../tools.md:218
msgid "Building and syncing"
msgstr "构建与同步"

#: ../../tools.md:220
msgid ""
"<span class=\"marker\">Run `/index` to build or rebuild the index.</span>"
" The first build walks every source file; subsequent builds sync from the"
" previous snapshot and are much faster. Add `force` to rebuild from "
"scratch."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"marker\">运行 `/index` "
"构建或重建索引。</span>首次构建会扫描所有源文件；后续构建会基于之前的快照同步，因此快得多。加上 `force` 可从头重建。"

#: ../../tools.md:224
msgid ""
"When an index already exists, minacode refreshes it in the background at "
"startup. After an agent turn, it <span class=\"marker\">automatically "
"updates small batches of changed source files</span>; run `/index` when a"
" large set of changes leaves it stale. `/status` shows the current state:"
msgstr ""
"索引已存在时，minacode 会在启动时后台刷新。Agent 完成一轮后，会<span "
"class=\"marker\">自动更新少量已修改的源文件</span>；如果大量改动导致索引过期，请运行 `/index`。`/status`"
" 会显示当前状态："

#: ../../tools.md:213
msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../tools.md:213
