#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Tab` moves the highlight; `Enter` "
#~ "submits the focused chip as your "
#~ "next message."
#~ msgstr "`Tab` 移动高亮；`Enter` 提交高亮的 chip 作为下一条消息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Tab` moves the highlight. `Enter` fills"
#~ " the focused chip into the input, "
#~ "where you can edit it first; a "
#~ "second `Enter` sends it. The prompt "
#~ "says so while a chip is focused:"
#~ " `Tab cycles suggestions · Enter "
#~ "fills the input, second Enter sends`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Tab` 移动高亮。`Enter` 会把选中的 chip "
#~ "填进输入框，你可以先修改；再按一次 `Enter` 才发送。有 chip "
#~ "被选中时提示符也会这么说：`Tab cycles suggestions · Enter"
#~ " fills the input, second Enter "
#~ "sends`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Describes or scripts tool calls in "
#~ "bulk: `action=\"describe\"` batch-reports call"
#~ " and return shapes with a json "
#~ "gate (built-in entries carry `json: "
#~ "no`), and `action=\"call\"` runs a "
#~ "Python script whose nested `call(name, "
#~ "...)` invocations cover built-in tools"
#~ " and MCP, keeping the usual "
#~ "confirmation and logging. It earns its"
#~ " keep at four or more same-"
#~ "shape calls whose individual results are"
#~ " not needed, since only what the "
#~ "script prints returns to the "
#~ "conversation; see [ToolScript](toolscript.md)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "批量描述或脚本化工具调用:`action=\"describe\"` 批量报告调用形状与返回形状并带 json"
#~ " gate(内置条目标 `json: no`),`action=\"call\"` 运行一个"
#~ " Python 脚本,其嵌套的 `call(name, ...)` 调用覆盖内置工具与"
#~ " MCP,保留常规的确认与日志。它的价值体现在四次及以上形状相同、且不需要逐条结果的调用上——因为只有脚本 print"
#~ " 的内容会回到对话中;见 [MCP](mcp.md#scripting-tool-calls)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Mentioning `@file:path` in your input "
#~ "points the agent at a file, but"
#~ " it is not a substitute for "
#~ "`Read` or `Search`: only a bounded "
#~ "excerpt is inlined, and the agent "
#~ "still reads and searches the rest "
#~ "of the project with its tools. "
#~ "Typing or selecting `@file:` opens fzf"
#~ " immediately; `Tab` does the same "
#~ "from an active file mention. An "
#~ "unavailable fzf uses a non-blocking "
#~ "literal fallback. Ignored paths and "
#~ "`.git` are never offered."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在输入中引用 `@file:path` 可以让 agent 关注某个文件，但它不能替代"
#~ " `Read` 或 `Search`：只有有上限的片段会被内联，agent "
#~ "仍会用工具读取和搜索项目的其余部分。输入或选中 `@file:` 会立即打开 "
#~ "fzf；在活动的文件引用中按 `Tab` 效果相同。fzf 不可用时则使用不阻塞输入的字面匹配 "
#~ "fallback。被忽略的路径和 `.git` 永远不会作为候选。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Mentioning `@file:path` points the agent "
#~ "at a file; it is not a "
#~ "substitute for `Read` or `Search`, and"
#~ " only a bounded excerpt is inlined."
#~ " See [Mentions](usage.md#mentions) for how "
#~ "picking files works."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在输入中提及 `@file:path` 会让 agent 关注某个文件;它不能替代 "
#~ "`Read` 或 `Search`,只会内联一段有边界的摘录。如何选择文件见 "
#~ "[Mentions](usage.md#mentions)。"

